      *> Class conditions IS [NOT] {NUMERIC | ALPHABETIC | ALPHABETIC-UPPER | ALPHABETIC-LOWER} over
      *> alphanumeric, signed/unsigned DISPLAY, packed, binary, and SIGN SEPARATE fields. Identical to cobc.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. P150.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 AX PIC X(4) VALUE "12 5".
       01 AL PIC X(4) VALUE "abCD".
       01 ND PIC S9(3) VALUE -12.
       01 NP PIC S9(3) COMP-3 VALUE -5.
       01 NB PIC 9(3) COMP VALUE 100.
       01 SS PIC S9(3) SIGN LEADING SEPARATE VALUE -7.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           IF AX IS NUMERIC DISPLAY "AX-N Y" ELSE DISPLAY "AX-N N" END-IF.
           IF AL IS ALPHABETIC DISPLAY "AL-A Y" ELSE DISPLAY "AL-A N" END-IF.
           IF AL IS ALPHABETIC-LOWER DISPLAY "AL-L Y" ELSE DISPLAY "AL-L N" END-IF.
           IF ND IS NUMERIC DISPLAY "ND-N Y" ELSE DISPLAY "ND-N N" END-IF.
           IF NP IS NUMERIC DISPLAY "NP-N Y" ELSE DISPLAY "NP-N N" END-IF.
           IF NB IS NUMERIC DISPLAY "NB-N Y" ELSE DISPLAY "NB-N N" END-IF.
           IF SS IS NUMERIC DISPLAY "SS-N Y" ELSE DISPLAY "SS-N N" END-IF.
           IF AX IS NOT NUMERIC DISPLAY "AX-NN Y" ELSE DISPLAY "AX-NN N" END-IF.
           STOP RUN.
